WEBVTT

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:21.640
You're still drinking, even though it's noon?

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.370
I just feel halfhearted somehow...

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:53.120
Do you remember when
I first went to see you?

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:58.020
Very well. You were a
presumptuous little girl.

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:06.000
I became an activist to
restore my father's honor,

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:13.130
but those pure intentions
might've been diluted at some point...

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:22.750
Skirmishing with the
government like we did last night

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:26.020
makes me nothing more than an outlaw.

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:29.590
Sounds like you still
haven't had enough work.

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:32.490
Will you come along?

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:35.390
I always have before.

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:45.430
I hope we make it in time.

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:47.240
I'm gonna burn up the highway!

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:49.610
Are you okay to drive?

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:52.630
I'll sober up along the way!

00:01:54.010 --> 00:02:01.620
Amid the difficulty of
sticking to that one feeling,

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:16.700
I want to protect you and fulfill
my promise to the only one for me

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:24.170
In a world filled with doubt,
I still can't find the answer

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:31.450
Even so, I continue forward... Why?

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:41.720
If I can change this dream-like
reality with my own two hands,

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:49.300
amid the difficulty of
sticking to that one feeling,

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:57.010
I want to protect the only one for me

00:02:57.010 --> 00:03:04.680
I swear on my beating heart I will
continue to run until I burn away

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:12.220
Amid the eternal love I feel simply by living,

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:21.220
I want to fulfill my promise

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:34.480
Triela!

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.880
Go on ahead, Hirscher-san!

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:38.610
But...!

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:04.740
Triela!

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:07.970
Please look for Cristiano!

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:28.760
Uncle!

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.300
Pinocchio!

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.830
Pinocchio...

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:35.770
I...

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:38.940
Didn't you hear the gunshots?!
Hurry and escape!

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:41.280
Please, Uncle!

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:44.270
I don't want to let you die!

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:50.780
Listen, Pinocchio! I've made up my mind!

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:56.320
I'm going to go into hiding!
You need to escape, too!

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:04.160
There's a car hidden in
the courtyard. Use this.

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:48.370
Pinocchio! I'm sorry!

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:52.640
Forgive me!

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.120
Hirscher-san...

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:04.090
Triela! Are you all right?!

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:06.600
Pinocchio got away.
I'm looking for him now.

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:10.550
I'm squaring off with a guard here!

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:12.700
Hirscher-san?!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:15.540
I'm fine! Go after Pinocchio!

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:17.270
Yes, sir!

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:56.040
I just can't hit him!

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:02.480
You... monster!

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:13.160
That's...

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:18.100
...the gun he stole from me in Montalcino!

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:39.360
How dare you shoot me...

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:42.980
...with that cherished gun
Hirscher-san gave me!

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:53.430
Who's the monster, again?!

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:59.630
As if you would ever
understand! I have to fight!

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:04.240
Likewise, then!

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:07.650
Alessio! Alessio!

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:09.780
Is the car ready to go?!

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:29.340
All right, it's Cristiano.
Put him in the car, Rico.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:31.570
Yes, Jean-san.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:44.190
- Ferro!
- Yes?

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:45.920
Any signs of backup coming?

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:49.290
No. We've turned all vehicles away.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:53.660
Marco. We have Cristiano.
We'll be taking the west route out.

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:55.360
Got it.

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:02.440
Giorgio. Can you see us?

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:05.370
- Yes.
- Bring the car.

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:43.400
A kid?!

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.820
Franco!

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.180
Rico!

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:17.440
Cristiano! Are you all right?!

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.610
Get him in the car!

00:10:57.290 --> 00:11:00.560
What are you doing here?

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:03.080
It's not for your sake!

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:06.220
It's for Pinocchio!

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:11.790
Where is he?!

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:16.500
Still in the mansion...

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.510
Marco!

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:23.010
Yeah?

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:26.580
Target has been abducted!
A red Alfa Romeo!

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.380
They'll be there any minute now!

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:31.420
Got it. We'll stop them here.

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:32.520
Angelica!

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:33.720
Yes, sir?!

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:36.930
A red car is coming. Stop it!

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:39.120
Understood!

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:44.600
Ridiculous...

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:51.560
Saving me will only
worsen things for yourselves...

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:58.810
Weren't you going to avenge your father?!

00:11:58.810 --> 00:12:03.410
That's right!
But I'm also going to help you two!

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:11.950
I can't just abandon you!

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:38.410
Ange!

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:48.830
Franca!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.700
Stay with me!

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:55.770
Franco...

00:12:58.610 --> 00:13:00.940
I'm sorry...

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:10.480
Franca! Wake up!
We can't make the turn at this speed!

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:14.350
Hit the brake!

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:23.500
Don't die, Caterina!

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:14.010
Triela!

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:46.170
We pulled the car out further downstream.

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:48.540
We have yet to find their bodies.

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:49.440
I see.

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:51.610
We're searching the mansion,

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:55.050
but it appears
Cristiano disposed of the documents.

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:58.690
It seems he anticipated the raid.

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:02.290
Leave the rest to the
Milan branch and return home.

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:05.060
I take it no cyborgs were lost?

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:07.130
Two suffered serious injuries.

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:08.500
I'll be sending them in the chopper,

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:12.090
