for site-specific replacements.

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:28.210
Triela!

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:32.180
Don't be so reckless!

00:17:32.180 --> 00:17:34.980
Hirscher-san...

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.970
I won...

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:07.380
Yeah.

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:12.720
Please praise me. I won.

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:38.310
Marco-san.

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:41.150
You're not injured at all?

00:18:41.150 --> 00:18:42.620
No, sir.

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:44.690
What about Triela and Rico?

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:46.620
