headquarters in the chopper.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:51.090
Their injuries aren't
life-threatening, though.

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:53.690
That's good.

00:18:57.730 --> 00:19:01.170
Umm, Marco-san...

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:07.340
I'm sorry.

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:08.880
For what?

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:12.180
For not being able to stop the car...

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:21.380
You're always apologizing, you know that?

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:36.600
You did great.

00:19:39.670 --> 00:19:41.740
